   1:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** /**
   2:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   * @file    py32e407_hal_uart.c
   4:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   * @author  MCU Application Team
   5:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   * @brief   UART HAL module driver.
   6:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   *          functionalities of the Universal Asynchronous Receiver Transmitter Peripheral (UART).
   8:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   *           + IO operation functions
  10:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   *           + Peripheral Control functions
  11:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   *           + Peripheral State and Errors functions
  12:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   @verbatim
  13:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  15:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   ==============================================================================
  16:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   [..]
  17:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     The UART HAL driver can be used as follows:
  18:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  19:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Declare a UART_HandleTypeDef handle structure (eg. UART_HandleTypeDef huart).
  20:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Initialize the UART low level resources by implementing the HAL_UART_MspInit() API:
  21:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****         (##) Enable the UARTx interface clock.
  22:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****         (##) UART pins configuration:
  23:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the UART GPIOs.
  24:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure these UART pins (TX as alternate function pull-up, RX as alternate func
  25:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****         (##) NVIC configuration if you need to use interrupt process (HAL_UART_Transmit_IT()
  26:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****              and HAL_UART_Receive_IT() APIs):
  27:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the UARTx interrupt priority.
  28:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the NVIC UART IRQ handle.
  29:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  30:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Program the Baud Rate, Word Length, Stop Bit, Parity, first bit(MSB/LSB) 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Temp\cckCYtgX.s 			page 2


  31:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****         and Mode(Receiver/Transmitter) in the huart Init structure.
  32:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  33:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Initialize the UART registers by calling the HAL_UART_Init() API.
  34:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  35:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
  36:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (@) The specific UART interrupts (Transmission complete interrupt,
  37:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             RXNE interrupt and Error Interrupts) will be managed using the macros
  38:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             __HAL_UART_ENABLE_IT() and __HAL_UART_DISABLE_IT() inside the transmit
  39:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             and receive process.
  40:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  41:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
  42:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (@)  HAL_UART_Init() configure also the low level Hardware GPIO, CLOCK, 
  43:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             CORTEX...etc) by calling the customized HAL_UART_MspInit() API.
  44:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  45:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     ##### Callback registration #####
  46:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     ==================================
  47:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  48:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  49:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     The compilation define USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
  50:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
  51:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  52:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  53:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     Use Function @ref HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
  54:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     Function @ref HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
  55:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
  56:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
  57:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxBlockCpltCallback       : Tx Block Complete Callback.
  58:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxHalfBlockCpltCallback   : Tx Half Block Complete Callback.
  59:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxSrcCpltCallback         : Tx Source Complete Callback.
  60:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxBlockCpltCallback       : Rx Half Block Complete Callback.
  61:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxHalfBlockCpltCallback   : Rx Block Complete Callback.
  62:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxDstCpltCallback         : Rx Destination Complete Callback.
  63:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
  64:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
  65:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortTransmitCpltCallback : Abort Transmit Complete Callback.
  66:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortReceiveCpltCallback  : Abort Receive Complete Callback.
  67:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) BreakFrameCallback        : Break Frame Detection Callback.
  68:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AddrMatchCallback         : Address Match Callback.
  69:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : UART MspInit.
  70:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : UART MspDeInit.
  71:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
  72:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     and a pointer to the user callback function.
  73:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  74:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  75:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     Use function @ref HAL_UART_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
  76:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     weak (surcharged) function.
  77:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     @ref HAL_UART_UnRegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
  78:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     and the Callback ID.
  79:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     This function allows to reset following callbacks:
  80:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
  81:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
  82:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxBlockCpltCallback       : Tx Block Complete Callback.
  83:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxHalfBlockCpltCallback   : Tx Half Block Complete Callback.
  84:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxSrcCpltCallback         : Tx Source Complete Callback.
  85:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxBlockCpltCallback       : Rx Half Block Complete Callback.
  86:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxHalfBlockCpltCallback   : Rx Block Complete Callback.
  87:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxDstCpltCallback         : Rx Destination Complete Callback.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Temp\cckCYtgX.s 			page 3


  88:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
  89:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
  90:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortTransmitCpltCallback : Abort Transmit Complete Callback.
  91:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortReceiveCpltCallback  : Abort Receive Complete Callback.
  92:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) BreakFrameCallback        : Break Frame Detection Callback.
  93:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AddrMatchCallback         : Address Match Callback.
  94:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : UART MspInit.
  95:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : UART MspDeInit.
  96:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
  97:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  98:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     By default, after the @ref HAL_UART_Init() and when the state is HAL_UART_STATE_RESET
  99:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak (surcharged) functions:
 100:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     examples @ref HAL_UART_TxCpltCallback(), @ref HAL_UART_RxCpltCallback().
 101:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are respectively
 102:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     reset to the legacy weak (surcharged) functions in the @ref HAL_UART_Init()
 103:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     and @ref HAL_UART_DeInit() only when these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 104:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     If not, MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the @ref HAL_UART_Init() and @ref HAL_UART_DeInit()
 105:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand).
 106:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 107:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 108:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_UART_STATE_READY state only.
 109:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit that can be registered/unregistered
 110:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     in HAL_UART_STATE_READY or HAL_UART_STATE_RESET state, thus registered (user)
 111:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 112:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 113:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     using @ref HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() before calling @ref HAL_UART_DeInit()
 114:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     or @ref HAL_UART_Init() function.
 115:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 116:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 117:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     When The compilation define USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 118:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     not defined, the callback registration feature is not available
 119:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     and weak (surcharged) callbacks are used.
 120:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 121:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
 122:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****         Two operation modes are available within this driver :
 123:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 124:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      *** Polling mode IO operation ***
 125:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      =================================
 126:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
 127:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (+) Send an amount of data in blocking mode using HAL_UART_Transmit()
 128:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (+) Receive an amount of data in blocking mode using HAL_UART_Receive()
 129:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 130:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      *** Interrupt mode IO operation ***
 131:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      ===================================
 132:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
 133:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (+) Send an amount of data in non blocking mode using HAL_UART_Transmit_IT()
 134:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (+) At transmission end of transfer HAL_UART_TxCpltCallback is executed and user can
 135:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             add his own code by customization of function pointer HAL_UART_TxCpltCallback
 136:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (+) Receive an amount of data in non blocking mode using HAL_UART_Receive_IT()
 137:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (+) At reception end of transfer HAL_UART_RxCpltCallback is executed and user can
 138:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             add his own code by customization of function pointer HAL_UART_RxCpltCallback
 139:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (+) In case of transfer Error, HAL_UART_ErrorCallback() function is executed and user can
 140:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****             add his own code by customization of function pointer HAL_UART_ErrorCallback
 141:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 142:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      *** UART HAL driver macros list ***
 143:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      =============================================
 144:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
ARM GAS  C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Temp\cckCYtgX.s 			page 4


 145:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        Below the list of most used macros in UART HAL driver.
 146:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 147:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****       (+) __HAL_UART_GET_FLAG : Check whether the specified UART flag is set or not
 148:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****       (+) __HAL_UART_CLEAR_FLAG : Clear the specified UART pending flag
 149:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****       (+) __HAL_UART_ENABLE_IT: Enable the specified UART interrupt
 150:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****       (+) __HAL_UART_DISABLE_IT: Disable the specified UART interrupt
 151:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****       (+) __HAL_UART_GET_IT_SOURCE: Check whether the specified UART interrupt has occurred or not
 152:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 153:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
 154:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (@) You can refer to the UART HAL driver header file for more useful macros
 155:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c **** 
 156:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****   @endverbatim
 157:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****      [..]
 158:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****        (@) Additionnal remark: If the parity is enabled, then the MSB bit of the data written
 159:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****            in the data register is transmitted but is changed by the parity bit.
 160:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****            Depending on the frame length defined by the M_E bit (8-bits or 9-bits),
 161:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****            the possible UART frame formats are as listed in the following table:
 162:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     +-------------------------------------------------------------+
 163:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     | M_E bit |  PCE bit  |            UART frame                 |
 164:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     |---------------------|---------------------------------------|
 165:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     |    0    |    0      |    | SB | 8 bit data | STB |          |
 166:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     |---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 167:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_uart.c ****     |    0    |    1      |    | SB | 8 bit data | PB | STB |     |
